{"id":"3c0ee882019a2c27","group":"62","path":"62/62-df-disjoint-range-separation.md","title":"Separation of Disjoint Injective Enumerations","display":"df-disjoint-range-separation — Separation of Disjoint Injective Enumerations","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)","book_abbrev":"62","label":"62-df-disjoint-range-separation","aliases":["62-df-disjoint-range-separation"],"display":"df-disjoint-range-separation — Separation of Disjoint Injective Enumerations","depends_on":["[[62-df-coded-function]]"],"source":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Lemma IV.4.4(3)","source_pages":[142,143],"source_pdf_pages":[160,161]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"62"},{"key":"label","html":"62-df-disjoint-range-separation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>62-df-disjoint-range-separation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-disjoint-range-separation — Separation of Disjoint Injective Enumerations"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c156c03daff0aff0\" href=\"?note=c156c03daff0aff0\" title=\"62-df-coded-function\">62-df-coded-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Lemma IV.4.4(3)"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>142</span><span>143</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>160</span><span>161</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Inj}\">\\(\\mathsf{Inj}\\)</span>、函数图与应用见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c156c03daff0aff0\" href=\"?note=c156c03daff0aff0\" title=\"62-df-coded-function\">62-df-coded-function</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,g,X\">\\(f,g,X\\)</span> 为数集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DRS}\">\\(\\mathrm{DRS}\\)</span> 在断言中引入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}disjoint\\text{-}range\\text{-}separation}\\vdash\\;\\mathrm{DRS}\\coloneqq\\forall f\\forall g[(\\mathsf{Inj}(f,N,N)\\land\\mathsf{Inj}(g,N,N)\\land\\forall m,n\\;f(m)\\ne g(n))\\to\\exists X\\forall m(f(m)\\in X\\land g(m)\\notin X)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}disjoint\\text{-}range\\text{-}separation}\\vdash\\;\\mathrm{DRS}\\coloneqq\\forall f\\forall g[(\\mathsf{Inj}(f,N,N)\\land\\mathsf{Inj}(g,N,N)\\land\\forall m,n\\;f(m)\\ne g(n))\\to\\exists X\\forall m(f(m)\\in X\\land g(m)\\notin X)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>前提用输出不相等表达不交，不假定两套值域作为集合已经存在。X 是一个分离集；其存在比要求 X 恰等于 f 的值域弱。原书限制为单射枚举，保持此条件以直接对照 IV.4.4。</p>\n<p>来源：第二版（2009），Lemma IV.4.4(3)；纸面页 142, 143；PDF 页 160, 161。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"62-df-coded-function","status":"resolved","id":"c156c03daff0aff0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-coded-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-coded-function","status":"resolved","id":"c156c03daff0aff0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{Inj}$、函数图与应用见 [[62-df-coded-function]]。$f,g,X$ 为数集；$\\mathrm{DRS}$ 在断言中引入。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{Inj}","display":false},{"tex":"f,g,X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DRS}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}disjoint\\text{-}range\\text{-}separation}\\vdash\\;\\mathrm{DRS}\\coloneqq\\forall f\\forall g[(\\mathsf{Inj}(f,N,N)\\land\\mathsf{Inj}(g,N,N)\\land\\forall m,n\\;f(m)\\ne g(n))\\to\\exists X\\forall m(f(m)\\in X\\land g(m)\\notin X)].","display":true}],"bytes":1267,"backlinks":[{"id":"c68a6ecbed6addff","anchor":"ref-101","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[62-df-disjoint-range-separation|Separation of Disjoint Injective Enumerations]]"},{"id":"a2ad5b59a046bcd5","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RCA}_0,\\mathrm{WKL}_0$ 见 [[62-df-RCA0]]、[[62-df-WKL0]]，$\\Sigma^0_1\\text{-}\\mathrm{Sep}(S_2)$ 见 [[62-df-Sigma01-separation]]，$\\mathrm{DRS}$ 见 [[62-df-disjoint-range-separation]]；有限或单射枚举引理见 [[62-lem-RCA0-Sigma1-enumeration]]，EquivOver 见 [[62-df-equivalence-over-base]]。"},{"id":"2f82a3f70705c4ee","anchor":"ref-43","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[62-df-disjoint-range-separation]]"},{"id":"271bc9074a256041","anchor":"ref-239","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[62-df-disjoint-range-separation]]"}],"outgoing":["c156c03daff0aff0"]}